<metadata><name>Dixie Butte from Dixie Summit Sno-Park</name><desc>or-vielbig-2e:330-1: route read from the book's text and sketch map. One trkseg per waypoint pair, in order; segment sources are in the trk desc. Geometry from OSM (ODbL, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors) and USFS EDW (public domain) where marked; 'straight' segments are off-trail connectors, not traced.</desc></metadata>
<wpt lat="44.536344" lon="-118.600201"><ele>1598.7</ele><name>Dixie Summit Sno-Park</name><desc>source: DB trailhead pin (OSM node 36580585 Dixie Summit, where NF 2610 leaves US 26); confidence: high; pdf_page: 332; book_elev_ft: 5251; quote: From Dixie Summit Sno-Park, follow Road 2610, the marked ski route, past the ski area</desc></wpt>
